      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a new master service agreement for a raw material supplier here in Munich. We're expecting some volatility in the market over the next year, so I need to make sure we're covered. Can you give me a checklist of standard terms and conditions we should include to protect us against supply chain disruptions and sudden price hikes?",
